sequenceDiagram
  actor Wr as Writer
  participant FE as WriterStudio
  participant Q as sceneSaveQueue
  participant C as ScriptController
  participant S as ScriptService
  participant V as ScriptVersionRepository
  participant Sc as SceneRepository
  Wr->>FE: Edit scenes
  FE->>Q: schedule(scenes), debounce 600 ms
  Q->>C: PUT /scripts/{id} (scenes, baseRevision)
  C->>S: updateDraft(id, req)
  S->>V: lockCurrentByProjectId, FOR UPDATE
  alt baseRevision differs from draftRevision
    S-->>C: 409 STALE_REVISION (currentRevision)
    C-->>Q: keep local edits, offer reload
  else revision matches
    S->>Sc: replace scenes, props validated
    S->>S: draftRevision + 1
    S-->>C: ScriptResponse(draftRevision)
    C-->>Q: 200 OK, store new revision
  end
